        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Shared rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;BaseEntity adds CreatedAt, ModifiedAt, CreatedBy, ModifiedBy and IsDeleted. DateTime fields use UTC. Prices are integer toman.&lt;br&gt;Product PublicId and Notification PublicId preserve legacy numeric API IDs. Slug and Seller.SourceId preserve external API keys.&lt;br&gt;PriceObservation is append-only. LatestOffer is the current state. Soft-deleted products retain history and their unique SourceId.&lt;br&gt;Own store may use an unmatched external seller ID stored in AppSetting. Nullable notification seller links are reconciled during import." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=14;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;fontColor=#0f172a;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="835" width="1455" height="145" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
